    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il est sorti d’une Ultra-Brèche. Il est composé de plusieurs petites entités qui s’assemblent pour n’en former qu’une seule.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It appeared from an Ultra Wormhole. Each one appears to be made up of many life-forms stacked one on top of each other.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ウルトラホールから　出現した。 複数の　生命が　積み上がり １匹を　形成している　ようだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "On suppose que cette mystérieuse forme de vie est une Ultra-Chimère. Si un mur se met en branle et vous attaque sans prévenir, c’est lui.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "When stone walls started moving and attacking, the brute’s true identity was this mysterious life-form, which brings to mind an Ultra Beast.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ＵＢらしき　謎の　生命体。 突然　動き出して　襲ってきた 石垣の　正体は　こいつだ。",
        "language": {
